# Build output. The baked font atlases under src/ui/assets/ are NOT
# ignored: they are committed so a normal build needs neither Python nor
# the source TTFs.
build/

# Assembled release directories. `make release` rebuilds one whole from
# build/ and the docs, so a committed copy could only ever be stale.
release/

# Host-side self-check binaries, built by `make check`.
tests/test_*
!tests/test_*.c

*.o
*.elf
*.ELF

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
